<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin says sacks security chief Lebed.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin says sacks security chief Lebed.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian President Boris Yeltsin on Thursday sacked security chief Alexander Lebed.</p>
<p>He announced the news on national television.</p>
</text>
